<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Kersaf issues cauionary notice.</title>
<headline>Kersaf issues cauionary notice.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kersaf Investments Ltd said on Friday it was in talks which could have an impact on its share price and urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>It gave no further details but drew investors attention to similar cautionaries issued recently by Servgro International Ltd and Interleisure Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
